# Build output at any depth. The `*` matters: amlc v2 writes builds-v2/
# and test-builds-v2/, which the old root-anchored `builds*/*` and
# `test-builds/*` missed -- am-lang-core-isolate had 1662 untracked
# files, burying the handful of real new sources among them.
**/builds*/
**/test-builds*/
docs/*
*.generated.c
*.o
.DS_Store
examples/**/builds/*
examples/**/dependencies/*
src/native-c/aros-x86-64/*
src/native-c/linux-arm64v8/*
